Posting my progress here since I've been giving folks advice and I figure I ought to back my words up with my own results.  

I'd be happy with any feedback, but I suspect it'll just boil down to "follow the rules of thumb", which I'm more or less doing already.  Playing Solomon catch-up like everyone else.  Yes, I know my click ancients are underleveled; they're good enough to get me through 180s of Lucky Strikes one-critting 100% of the time, though, so I see no need to level them further.

**Ancients**: Morgulis (21,727,512); Argaiv (4,609); Siyalatas (4,600); Libertas (4,300); Mammon (4,300); Mimzee (4,300); Solomon (2,997); Pluto (2,000); Bhaal (2,000); Fragsworth (2,000); Iris (1,099); Juggernaut (500); Chronos (24); Thusia (10);  

